cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Analysis code for: Early Progression From SCAI Stage A/B to C/D/E in ICU Patients and its Prediction Using Machine Learning: A MIMIC-IV Study"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: "Python analysis code (cohort assembly, CSWG-SCAI staging, feature selection, machine-learning model development, and validation) for a MIMIC-IV study of 24-hour progression from SCAI shock stage A/B to C/D/E. The repository contains code only; no MIMIC-IV data or trained models."
authors:
